# ── Private operational layer — NEVER tracked in this public repo ─────────────
# The public repo serves only what patients' and clinicians' browsers fetch:
# the two pages, the data files, and the QR library. Everything below runs the
# quality pipeline on medrics infrastructure and stays out of public view.
# Business intelligence — prospect trusts he is TARGETING. Data .json files
# are otherwise public (the site serves them), so this one needs naming.
trust_prospects.json
# Owner rule 2026-08-04: "public knowledge is only the leaflets." The trust
# registry is SPLIT — trusts.json (tracked) carries only what a browser needs;
# contact/consent/census/board/notes live in this overlay, merged at read time
# by trust_registry.load_trusts(). public_gate.py (pre-commit + pre-push
# hooks) enforces the schema and scans all content for private markers.
trusts_private.json
